# Project structure

This is a single-product marketing site. Keep it small.

| Folder | Owns |
|---|---|
| `src/app/` | Routes and metadata only |
| `src/components/chrome/` | Persistent shell: AppShell, Nav, Footer, PageTransition, Logo |
| `src/components/demo/` | Request-a-demo overlay |
| `src/components/legal/` | `LegalPage` document template |
| `src/components/sections/` | Page blocks (Hero, Features, Cta, …) |
| `src/components/ui/` | Primitives with no page knowledge |
| `src/content/` | All copy, nav, URLs, form options |
| `src/lib/` | Non-UI behavior only |

Pages compose sections. They do not mount Nav/Footer, set page padding, or embed copy.

```tsx
// ✅
export default function HomePage() {
  return (
    <>
      <Hero />
      <PositioningBand />
    </>
  );
}

// ❌
export default function HomePage() {
  return (
    <div className="px-5 pt-32">
      <h1>Software for Luxury Fleets</h1>
      <Footer />
    </div>
  );
}
```

Naming: component file = export (`LegalPage.tsx`). Data files camelCase (`privacyPolicy.ts`). Routes kebab-case. Do not add `src/features/`, barrels, or unused product/theme leftovers.
